    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d720">

                <pb facs="0865" n="791" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v01/pg791"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.67m51</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in France</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Sharp</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-05-29T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 29, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2294. Investigate fully and report promptly status of Armenian representative
                    accredited to France. What status does this representative claim, what does he
                    state to be the purpose of his mission, and how is he received by French
                    Government?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
